              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Captured from local iOS Simulator with a local fixture user only. Settings email was redacted in the generated screenshot asset. Auth baseline shows the app-provided sample finn@example.com value, not a private account. Admin screens were not captured. Wordle submit controls extended below the first viewport, so that screenshot records a visible-board state and touch-density concern. No production data, release, deploy, or application UI source was changed.",
              "lineHeight": 1.24,
              "fontFamily": "$font-body",
              "fontSize": 16,
              "fontWeight": "700"
            }
          ]
