              "name": "Native Principle Text 6",
              "fill": "$native-ink",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Design for weak connectivity: cache last known home/collection/PvP readiness, show stale timestamps, and offer retry without losing the current route.",
